---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          COMPLETE MARKETING AUTOMATION FOR ECOMMERCE AND RETAILERS
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
         Smart Workflows with Proven Outcomes for Heartland 
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
            Develop AI-driven workflows to improve user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Expand your store and increase revenue through automated loyalty marketing strategies.
        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover -mb-12 rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.webp" width="1072" height="701"
          alt="Workflows for heartland retail gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
              Seamlessly integrate your Heartland POS with leading eCommerce platforms and apps for customized workflows. Effortlessly craft smooth and effective customer experiences in just a few clicks.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Develop tailored workflows to initiate advanced, data-driven marketing campaigns. Seamlessly incorporate features such as store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into comprehensive workflows aimed at attracting, converting, and retaining customers.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Craft fully automated, data-driven marketing campaigns customized for your customers. Provide personalized incentives based on each customer’s behavior and profile, including rewards, cashbacks, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, and store credits, to boost engagement and nurture loyalty.
            </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
